Arggghh. I had a great Ranger going: GDSM, bag of holding, intrinsic
protection of 1, ice troll as a pet, tons of gold. Then I ventured
into a graveyard on DL 17 or so and began hacking away at a marilith
with Stormbringer. I wasn't getting very far, but wasn't losing many
HP either (AC -21 or so). So I tried shooting off a bolt of fire --
which hit another marilith and got it mad at me. So now I've got two
mariliths attacking me, but I'm still doing okay due to my low AC.
Then an incubus shows up and strips me of everything (except for maybe
my gloves or some other insignificant piece of armor) and teleports
away, probably snickering to himself in glee.
So there I am, naked, in the middle of a graveyard with two attacking
mariliths. No scrolls of teleport, no wand of teleport. I started
shooting off bolts of fire, but unfortunately the mariliths killed me
almost instantly.
Then my amulet of life saving kicked in.
Unfortunately, in the turn it used up to save me, they pulled my HP
back down to 22 out of 80 almost instantly. I lost my head -- forgot
about my wand of digging, remembered about Elbereth but thought that
demons didn't respect it. In a last-ditch bid to save my life I pulled
out my wand of polymorph and started zapping it, forgetting that
they're polymorph resistant (and not realizing that, with my luck,
they'd probably change into something just as bad.)
Then I died. AGAIN. No AoLS this time.
And I had hoped to ascend this one. ARRRRGGGHHHH.

